    {
      "description": "This is a list of privacy-respecting frontends to popular services like social media. All of them are cross-plattform webapps and should work on your device no matter the OS and hardware.\nⓘ You can suggest new frontends and modifications to the list here.\nThanks to 3nprob, aaferrari, heartlog, NxOne14, ZekXtreme, TimDaub, privacytime101, HexagonCDN, Odyssey346, gi-yt, Solomon1732 and lolcatw for their contributions!\nYoutube • YT Music • Reddit • Twitter • Imgur • Tiktok • Medium • Quora • GitHub • StackOverflow • IMDb • Genius • XVideos • Fandom • Translate • Search Engines • Instagram • Odysee • Wikipedia • Tools\n☰ You can jump between sections via the little menu icon above to the left.\nⓘ Check out the tools section at the bottom to find out how to easily adopt and even self-host.",
